From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BouBou <69978359+BouBouw@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rustic: ui skin, a look for the shared widgets

An executable may install one widget skin (horizon_client_render::ui::skin):
ui::nine_slice, ui::blit_sprite, ui::tiled(_sized) and HudBatch::sprite_scaled ask
it before drawing a GUI sprite, ui::scrolling_text_around_at and ui::centered_text
before setting a label, and the title's own buttons too; Game::hud calls
Skin::begin with the frame's atlas. With no skin nothing changes. Rustic ADR 0013, U15.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
